---
title: View a Debt Projection
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor FU as Finance User
    participant UI as UserInterface
    participant C as Controller
    participant DBH as DatabaseHandler
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    participant D as Debt
    participant DPC as DebtPayoffCalculator
    participant DP as DebtProjection



    FU ->> UI: Select Debt and click view projection
    UI ->> C: Request debt projection with debtID
    C ->> DBH: Load debt with debtID
    DBH ->> DB: Get debt row
    DB -->> DBH: Return debt row

    alt Debt found
        DBH -->> D: create Debt object
        DBH -->> C: return Debt
        C ->> D: Get balance
        D -->> C: Return balance
        C ->> D: Get APR
        D-->> C: Return APR
        C ->> D: Get monthly payment
        D -->> C: Return monthly payment
        C ->> DPC: calculatePayoff(balance, APR, payment)
        DPC -->> DP: create DebtProjection
        loop for every month
            DPC ->> DPC: Calculate monthly interest
            DPC ->> DPC: Apply monthly payment
            DPC ->> DPC: Update remaining balance
            DPC ->> DP: Add monthly balance
        end
        DPC ->> DP: Set payoff months
        DPC ->> DP: Set total interest
        DPC -->> C: Return Debt Projection
        C -->> UI: Return projection results
        UI -->> FU: Display payoff time, total interest, and graph

    else Debt not found or calculation error
        DBH -->> C: Return error
        C -->> UI: Return error
        UI -->> FU: Display error message
    end
